OL,3,ASir David Beckham nets #38.5m after
OL,4,AWorld Cup ad deals
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir David Beckham has netted a #38.5m
OL,7,Fpayout from his sports, fashion, and
OL,8,Fmedia business after the 2026 Men's
OL,9,FFootball World Cup helped it bring in
OL,10,Frecord profits.
OL,12,FThe former England star's DRJB
OL,13,FHoldings, which includes the Beckham
OL,14,Fbrand, reported an almost #50m profit
OL,15,Fin 2025, a 46% jump compared to a year
OL,16,Fearlier. Sales rose from #72.2m to
OL,17,F#84m.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
