OL,3,ASir David Beckham nets #38.5m after
OL,4,AWorld Cup ad deals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rise was driven by a slew of
OL,7,Fadvertising partnerships struck in the
OL,8,Frunup to the tournament, including with
OL,9,FBank of America, McDonald's, Verizon,
OL,10,Fand PepsiCo Lay's.
OL,12,FSir David, Britain's first billionaire
OL,13,Fsportsman, was commonly seen in adverts
OL,14,Fduring the summer's World Cup.
